][This][ report][ is][ a][ companion][ report][ to][ the][ Organisation][ for][ Economic][ Co][-][operation][ and][ Development][ (][O][ECD][),][ Education][ at][ a][ Gl][ance][ 2015][,][ which][ presents][ complete][ data][ for][ all][ OECD][ member][ countries][,][ including][ Canada][.][
